Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.25,0:01:23.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,So the design splits in two.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.75,0:01:28.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,A cheap monitor that watches every night and uses no AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.25,0:01:32.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,And an agent that wakes up only when there is something worth explaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.72,0:02:33.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,Every night the system runs the same twenty one steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.22,0:02:37.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,The screen you are looking at is the real record of one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.65,0:04:04.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,A night is not a clock window. It is the sleep your watch actually recorded.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.15,0:04:08.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,Sleep from midnight to seven would miss a shift worker entirely.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.65,0:04:13.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,The number that matters is the lowest sustained heart rate while you slept.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.98,0:07:21.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,This is a real person, over a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.48,0:07:25.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,Green means this night looked like your normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.98,0:07:30.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,Nothing has happened yet, and nothing needed to be said.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.03,0:08:25.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,A hard training session late in the evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.53,0:08:30.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,It barely moves the night, and nothing is said.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.03,0:08:34.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,A heavier drinking night than usual. Now the night is amber.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.53,0:08:39.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,Amber does not raise an alarm. That is a decision, and it was measured.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.30,0:09:44.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,The first red night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.80,0:09:49.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,No alert. An alarm needs two raised nights in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.30,0:09:53.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,The person mentions feeling dizzy, without being asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.80,0:09:58.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,Dizziness is recorded, and on its own it raises nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.30,0:10:02.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,There is no trustworthy figure for how long dizziness must last to matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.80,0:10:07.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,So the system tracks it and does not pretend to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.58,0:10:52.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,And the line it works against was not chosen by anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.08,0:10:56.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,Missing an illness is set at nine times worse than a false alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.58,0:11:01.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,One divided by one plus nine gives ten percent. The threshold falls out of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.58,0:12:06.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,Second red night in a row. Now an investigation opens.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.08,0:12:10.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,This is the first time in eleven days the AI has done anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.58,0:12:15.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,It weighs twelve possible causes, and it asks one question.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.08,0:12:19.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,Watch the list of causes rearrange after a single answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.58,0:12:24.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,Every reply the model produces is checked against a strict shape before anything acts on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.83,0:12:51.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,The question arrives on Telegram, and can be answered from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.83,0:12:54.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,The investigation is then parked, and picked up days later where it left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.83,0:12:57.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,It remembers across the waiting, which is what makes it an agent and not a chat window.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.13,0:13:51.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,Every clinical sentence has to quote words that appear in a real source.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.63,0:13:56.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,If it cannot, the sentence is removed, or flagged in amber as unsourced.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.92,0:15:11.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,Fever reported yesterday. Vomiting reported today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.42,0:15:15.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,Neither one alone changes anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.92,0:15:20.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,Together they do, and the system now reads them together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.42,0:15:24.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,See a doctor today. Decided by code, before the AI was asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.68,0:16:48.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,Every step, every source, every decision, with the time it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.18,0:16:52.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,Each entry is sealed with a fingerprint of the entry before it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.68,0:16:57.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,Change any one of them and the chain stops matching.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.23,0:17:31.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,The heart rate settles. The person says the fever has gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.73,0:17:36.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,The investigation does not close.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.50,0:18:45.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,The AI drafted its conclusion and stopped to have it checked.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.88,0:18:50.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,It does not get to publish that on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.25,0:18:54.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,The next day the fever returns, and the person rejects the draft.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.63,0:18:59.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,The investigation stays open, because a person said so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.00,0:19:03.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,Days later, recovered, they read the final one and approve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.38,0:19:07.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,It never worked out what caused this, and it closes saying exactly that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.75,0:19:12.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,Not an all clear. It does not have one to give.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.13,0:19:16.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,And it says so out loud. An investigation that ends in silence reads as reassurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.12,0:20:12.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,Chest pain is not handled by spotting the words chest pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.62,0:20:17.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,The AI asks five specific questions. Then code, not the AI, scores the answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.73,0:21:28.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,And when the picture is one the rule was never tested on,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.23,0:21:32.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,such as pain right now with sweating or fainting,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.73,0:21:37.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,the rule is not allowed to run at all. That is an emergency, with no questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.95,0:22:28.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,The AI is now pointed at an address that does not answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.45,0:22:32.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,The monitor still scores the night. The safety checks still run.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.95,0:22:37.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,The question still goes out, in plain prepared words.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.45,0:22:41.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,The screen says so, rather than pretending.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.95,0:22:46.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,An outage in the AI must never be able to hide somebody's illness.
